			 <p><b>HOW TO</b><br>
    <li>Submit a claim <a href="https://cargoclaims.aero/cms?path=/cargoclaims/docs/howto_submit_claim" target="_blank">click here</a></li>
    <li>View or update existing claims <a href="https://cargoclaims.aero/cms?path=/cargoclaims/docs/your_account" target="_blank">click here</a></li>
    <li>Login to your account <a href="https://www.cargoclaims.aero/contact/access?action=login" target="_blank">here</a></li>
    <br><br>
				<p>A cargo claim is a written complaint demanding financial compensation from cebu pacific Cargo for loss of, damage or<br /> delay to cargo whilst in care and control pursuant to a contract of carriage.</p>
				<p>In the case of damage or delay, the person entitled to delivery must complain to cebu pacific Cargo within the time lines stated below. If no complaint is made within the times indicated below, then no action can be brought against cebu pacific Cargo.</p>
			</div>
