			<div  style="padding: 10px 30px !important;">
				<p><b>REQUIREMENTS FOR CLAIM:</p></b>
				<p style="font-family:Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 16px;">Intent to claim/preliminary letter.<br /> A preliminary letter must be submitted within time limit of CONDITIONS OF CONTRACT through main channels:</p>
